{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39332","headline":"过渼陂怀旧 · 韦庄","name":"过渼陂怀旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辛勤曾寄玉峰前，一别云溪二十年。\n三径荒凉迷竹树，四邻凋谢变桑田。\n渼陂可是当时事，紫阁空余旧日烟。\n多少乱离无处问，夕阳吟罢涕潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}